join Sipho (Neutral) left
join Hope (Neutral) right
update Sipho (Warm)
join Lebo (Neutral) left
Sipho: Lebo's doing the gutters. He says my joints would leak and he's probably right.
- You've been waiting a long time for this
	Hope: You've been waiting a long time for this.
	Sipho: Since our drum overflowed and went bad in a night. Feels longer than it was.
	Sipho: It's strange having the actual thing. I've had the drawing of it in my head so long the real one feels like a copy.
- Is it what you imagined?
	Hope: Is it what you imagined?
	Sipho: It's better. The drawing didn't have Lebo swearing at a downpipe in it.
	Sipho: I heard that!
	Lebo: You were meant to!
[signal arg="hearts:sipho:1"]
set {GameState.schoolhouse_system_built} = true
set {GameState.sipho_schoolhouse_excitement_flag} = true
